{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/uwc3vj","slideIndex":5,"text":"战斗核心是能量管理和卡牌组合。Battle统一维护手牌、抽牌堆、弃牌堆和消耗区，结算伤害、格挡与状态。每次结算还会产生BattleCue，界面用这些提示播放动作、数字和音效，让规则与演出保持同步。建议用时50秒。\n\n项目依据：\nAssets/Sleigh/Scripts/Battle/SleighBattle.cs: Battle / BattleCue / DamageCalc / BlockCalc\nAssets/Sleigh/Scripts/UI/SleighBattleView.cs\nAssets/Sleigh/Scripts/Presentation/GameRoot.BattleEffects.cs\nAssets/Sleigh/Resources/Sleigh/Art/Festival/FestivalItemsAtlas.png\n配图来自本项目现有美术或离线预览，不代表完整运行截图。"}
