{"kind":"notes","id":"nt/87y4vn","slideIndex":8,"text":"表现层使用春节场景、粒子、转场和战斗反馈；减少动态效果可以降低装饰动画。数据层用Definitions和中文本地化文件管理内容，图集通过JSON索引读取。UI使用对象池减少反复创建，复用时清除旧回调。音频由SleighAudio调度，声音已经作为资源准备，运行时不合成。建议用时50秒。\n\n项目依据：\nDocs/ProjectStructure.md\nAssets/Sleigh/Scripts/Presentation/SpringFestivalBackdrop.cs\nAssets/Sleigh/Scripts/Presentation/PixelIrisTransition.cs\nAssets/Sleigh/Scripts/Data/SleighData.cs\nAssets/Sleigh/Scripts/Data/Chinese.cs\nAssets/Sleigh/Scripts/Utilities/PixelPoolBucket.cs\nAssets/Sleigh/Scripts/Audio/SleighAudio.cs\nAssets/Sleigh/Resources/Sleigh/Art/Festival/FestivalEnemiesAtlas.png\nAssets/Sleigh/Resources/Sleigh/Art/Icons/FestivalHudAtlas.png\n配图来自本项目现有美术或离线预览，不代表完整运行截图。"}
